    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BuzzFeed called it second\nlargest income stream content revenue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545085,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is really just a nice way of saying\npaid media and product placement."
